{"id":"wb-6-1038","name":"陈毅故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈毅故居","text":"陈毅故居位于中国四川省资阳市乐至县劳动镇中。是中华人民共和国十大元帅之一陈毅诞生并居住的地方。\n\n1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。10月，该处被整修之后开放参观。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E6%AF%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93085598,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93085598","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/967caef501648670f29d032e.jpg","title":"陈毅故居照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%99%88%E6%AF%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/%E9%99%88%E6%AF%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Chen Yi's former residence","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}